1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,389
The audition circuit that produced her is its own economy.

2
00:00:03,389 --> 00:00:09,974
Hundreds of thousands of Korean kids audition every year across the big agencies and the mid-tier ones.

3
00:00:09,974 --> 00:00:15,103
Of those signed, the large majority are released from their contracts before debut.

4
00:00:15,103 --> 00:00:23,595
The math is closer to elite athletics than to music school — early specialization, private coaching, and a pyramid with almost no middle.

